# Short and direct: the desire and the request, without the line about
# perceiving what is greater than the physical world. This is the form the
# Astral Campfire tape used. It is a choice, not an omission.
#
# Said in phrases, with a pause after each for the listener to repeat it, as
# in the settled form.

@segment   affirmation-direct
@title     The Gateway Affirmation — short and direct
@levels    F10
@family    affirmation
@fixed
@duration  ~1m30s

say Say in your mind. Say to yourself.
pause 4
say I am more than my physical body,
pause 3.5
say because I am more than physical matter.
pause 6
say I deeply desire to expand.
pause 3
say To experience.
pause 2
say To know.
pause 2
say To understand.
pause 2
say To control.
pause 6
say To use such greater energies and energy systems
pause 3.5
say as may be beneficial and constructive to me,
pause 3.5
say and to those near and close to me.
pause 6
say I deeply desire the help and cooperation,
pause 3.5
say the assistance, the understanding,
pause 2.5
say of those individuals whose wisdom, development, and experience
pause 3.5
say are equal or greater than my own.
pause 10
